      <rules>
        <rule name="Strongman" id="e89b-d4b3-6463-f3b9" hidden="false">
          <description>Blackguards are capable of great feats of strength.


They may use a double-handed weapon without the usual penalty of always striking last.
Work out order of battle as you would with other weapons.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Unreliable Hirelings" id="a9c5-d5ad-85f4-201e" hidden="false">
          <description>Blackguards are only hired by the Merchant to serve him by protecting his cargo.
They are not much trusted or granted with any responsibilities.
Therefore they may never become Heroes.


Re-roll all results of ‘The lad’s got talent’ for them.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
